  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656462",
      "title": "TD: Creating the Form and Registering the Controls",
      "lectureOrder": 511,
      "videoOrder": 468,
      "sourceHash": "260d673ff2438a5ff7d3556a69e7adbdcad2ce8bb9473f3986f20f36ed28e8a6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.083,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.083,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "we had a look at the basic setup of our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 7.98,
          "en": "Now let's understand how Angular creates such a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 11.04,
          "en": "JavaScript object representing our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.04,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "in the template driven approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 15.99,
          "en": "The great thing is you don't have to do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.99,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "while almost anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 21.27,
          "en": "Make sure that in your app module you actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.27,
          "end": 25.35,
          "en": "import the forms module added here to your imports array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.35,
          "end": 27.81,
          "en": "and have the import at the top of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.81,
          "end": 31.29,
          "en": "As the name implies, this built-in module shipping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.29,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "with Angular includes a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "of forms related functionalities and is actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "needed to get this template driven approach to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 44.13,
          "en": "work to get this form creation by Angular to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.13,
          "end": 46.14,
          "en": "Now by default in a CLI project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.14,
          "end": 47.61,
          "en": "this should already be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "So it show to work fine, but again, I'm just highlighting it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.58,
          "en": "because it's super important that you have this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.58,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "Otherwise, the following steps will not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "With this imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 62.13,
          "en": "angular will actually automatically create a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 64.86,
          "en": "for you, so a JavaScript representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "of that form when it detects a form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "in HTML code like it does here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 73.32,
          "en": "So you can think of that form element serving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 77.34,
          "en": "as a selector for some angular directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.34,
          "end": 80.34,
          "en": "which then creates such a JavaScript representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.34,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "of the form for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 86.43,
          "en": "Of course, you can't see that form representation as of now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.43,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "and it would be very empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "because one thing does not happen automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 95.94,
          "en": "Angular will not automatically detect your inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.94,
          "end": 97.05,
          "en": "in this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 99.27000000000001,
          "en": "And the simple reason for this is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.27000000000001,
          "end": 101.43,
          "en": "while you could argue that it should be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.43,
          "end": 104.58,
          "en": "scan your HTML code and detect that you have an input here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "and here and that you have a select dropdown here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 111.69,
          "en": "you still might not want to add all these elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.69,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "as controls to your form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "So with control, I'm referring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 117.96000000000001,
          "en": "to what is in the JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "And again, not every input in your HTML code might be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "a control you want to have in your JavaScript form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "Maybe you have a dropdown which value only changes something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "you view on the UI, but the import should not actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 134.55,
          "en": "be part of what gets submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.55,
          "end": 136.8,
          "en": "Maybe you use some third party package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "which adds some custom form controls, which are not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "labeled input, which don't use input as a selector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.04,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "and then Angular would have no chance of detecting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "that this is a control of your form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "So you still need to register controls manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 155.25,
          "en": "You need to tell Angular, \"Hey, within that form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "what should be an actual control of my form?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "And this is what we're going to do now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.38,
          "end": 163.17000000000002,
          "en": "Tell Angular how does our form look like?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.17000000000002,
          "end": 165.3,
          "en": "Which controls do we want to have?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 168.51,
          "en": "In the template of an approach, this is super simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.51,
          "end": 171.18,
          "en": "You simply pick the input which you want to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.18,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "as a control, like this input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "And I'm just going to structure it a bit different to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 179.7,
          "en": "split it up over multiple lines to make it easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 183.75,
          "en": "And then you add NG model like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.75,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "Now you might already know NG model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "from the two-way binding, two-way data binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 193.08,
          "en": "and it actually is the same directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 197.122,
          "en": "in two-way data binding, though you saw that we used it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.122,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "with square brackets and parentheses wrapping NG model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 204.12,
          "en": "Now we will have a look at this later again, but for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 206.67000000000002,
          "en": "let's add without any parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.67000000000002,
          "end": 209.67000000000002,
          "en": "without any squared brackets, just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.67000000000002,
          "end": 212.197,
          "en": "This will be enough to tell Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.197,
          "end": 217.197,
          "en": "\"Hey, this input is actually a control of my form.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.95,
          "end": 222.95,
          "en": "So NNG model in the end is a directive made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.32,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "in the forms module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 226.82999999999998,
          "en": "Something I mentioned earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "in the course when we had a look at two-way data binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 231.39,
          "en": "This is key to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 231.39,
          "end": 234.24,
          "en": "you can use it to get two-way data binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.24,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "but it actually is part of a bigger module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 241.53,
          "en": "with more features giving you full control over forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.53,
          "end": 246.06,
          "en": "Now for this to work, for this to be recognized as a control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.06,
          "end": 249.42,
          "en": "in your form, we need to give Angular one hour piece",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 253.2,
          "en": "of information, the name of this control right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.2,
          "end": 255.93,
          "en": "it would say, \"Okay, this input should be part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 255.93,
          "end": 259.89,
          "en": "of the JavaScript object representation of this forum.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.89,
          "end": 261.57,
          "en": "So whatever the user enters here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 261.57,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "as a value should be the value of my well of this control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 266.19,
          "end": 267.99,
          "en": "But what's the name of that control?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.99,
          "end": 270.42,
          "en": "We need to give that information to Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 270.42,
          "end": 274.68,
          "en": "And we do this by adding the normal HTML attribute name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.68,
          "end": 276.96,
          "en": "So name is nothing, Angler is too specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.96,
          "end": 279.54,
          "en": "Name is the default attribute you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 279.54,
          "end": 282.18,
          "en": "to any HTML control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.18,
          "end": 283.83,
          "en": "Now here the name might be username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 283.83,
          "end": 286.26,
          "en": "because that is what we can enter in this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 286.26,
          "end": 290.31,
          "en": "And with this, this control will be registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.31,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "in this JavaScript representation of the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.85,
          "end": 295.8,
          "en": "Now, I'll do the same for the email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.8,
          "end": 298.5,
          "en": "restructure it so that it's easier to read",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 303.5,
          "en": "add NG model and add a name like for example, email here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 308.76,
          "en": "Well, and the same is true for the select here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.76,
          "end": 311.97,
          "en": "which is just another type of HTML input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.97,
          "end": 316.53,
          "en": "Here we can also add NNG model and we can add a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.53,
          "end": 319.98,
          "en": "like secret because am I asking for a secret question here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.98,
          "end": 323.37,
          "en": "And with that we registered all the controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 323.37,
          "end": 327.18,
          "en": "Of course we can't see that much though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 327.18,
          "end": 329.31,
          "en": "Well, that is something we're going to have a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329.31,
          "end": 331.35,
          "en": "at in the next lecture when we see how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.35,
          "end": 333.06,
          "en": "we can submit such a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.06,
          "end": 336.36,
          "en": "and therefore how we can see these key value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.36,
          "end": 340.413,
          "en": "pairs representing what the user entered into which input.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
